{"title":"Chromium","sourceTitle":"Chromium/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Chromium\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Chromium (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Chromium/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"铬 (100% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:300px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Lingote de cromo</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ingot-chromium.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/a/af/Ingot-chromium.png/100px-Ingot-chromium.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/a/af/Ingot-chromium.png/150px-Ingot-chromium.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/a/af/Ingot-chromium.png/200px-Ingot-chromium.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Empilhável</b>\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"TC\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Fundível</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Ponto de cheiro</b>\n</td>\n<td>1907°C\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Requer contêiner</b>\n</td>\n<td>Sim\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Saída</b>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Ingot_mold\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Ingot mold\">Lingoteira</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Valor de saída</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Items\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Itens</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Crómio</b> é um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Metal\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Metal\">metal</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Metal\" title=\"Metal\"> </a></span> encontrado no minério de cromita. A cromita é usada na produção de <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Sturdy_leather\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Sturdy leather\">sturdy leather</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Sturdy_leather\" title=\"Sturdy leather\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Dye\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Dye\">dyeing</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Dye\" title=\"Dye\"> </a></span>.\n</p><p><span id=\"Obtaining\"></span>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Obtenção\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Obtenção</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Processando\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Processando</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Pulverização\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Pulverização</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Elenco\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Elenco</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Uso\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Uso</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Couro_resistente\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Couro resistente</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Tingimento\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Tingimento</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#História\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">História</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Galeria\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Galeria</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Referências\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Referências</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span id=\"Obten.C3.A7.C3.A3o\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtenção\">Obtenção</span></h2>\n<p>O minério de cromita pode ser encontrado na maioria dos tipos ígneos <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Rock\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Rock\">rock</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Rock\" title=\"Rock\"> </a></span>: andesito, basalto, granito, peridotito e kimberlito. É um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Ore_Deposits#Deep_ores\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Ore Deposits\">deep ore</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Ore_Deposits#Deep_ores\" title=\"Ore Deposits\"> </a></span>, o que significa que não possui depósitos rasos ou pedras soltas na superfície.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>Os depósitos de cromita são gerados a uma altitude entre 0 e 0,4 de <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Sea_level\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Sea level\">sea level</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Sea_level\" title=\"Sea level\"> </a></span>. Em um mundo com configurações de altura padrão, isso varia de Y = 0 a Y = 44. O depósito tem formato de disco com raio de 5 a 15 blocos. O Chromite tem 3 tentativas por bloco para gerar, o que o torna muito raro.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n</div><div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"width: 400px; text-align: center;\">\n<caption>Minério de cromita na rocha hospedeira\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Pedra\n</th>\n<th>Bloco normal\n</th>\n<th>Bloco de minério\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Andesito\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Rock-andesite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/b/ba/Rock-andesite.png/100px-Rock-andesite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/ba/Rock-andesite.png/150px-Rock-andesite.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/b/ba/Rock-andesite.png/200px-Rock-andesite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-chromite-andesite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/c/c0/Ore-chromite-andesite.png/100px-Ore-chromite-andesite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/c/c0/Ore-chromite-andesite.png/150px-Ore-chromite-andesite.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/c/c0/Ore-chromite-andesite.png/200px-Ore-chromite-andesite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Basalto\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Rock-basalt.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/b/bb/Rock-basalt.png/100px-Rock-basalt.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/bb/Rock-basalt.png/150px-Rock-basalt.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/b/bb/Rock-basalt.png/200px-Rock-basalt.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-chromite-basalt.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/d/d7/Ore-chromite-basalt.png/100px-Ore-chromite-basalt.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/d/d7/Ore-chromite-basalt.png/150px-Ore-chromite-basalt.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/d/d7/Ore-chromite-basalt.png/200px-Ore-chromite-basalt.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Granito\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Rock-granite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/8/89/Rock-granite.png/100px-Rock-granite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/8/89/Rock-granite.png/150px-Rock-granite.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/8/89/Rock-granite.png/200px-Rock-granite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-chromite-granite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/4/4a/Ore-chromite-granite.png/100px-Ore-chromite-granite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/4/4a/Ore-chromite-granite.png/150px-Ore-chromite-granite.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/4/4a/Ore-chromite-granite.png/200px-Ore-chromite-granite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Peridotito\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Rock-peridotite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/3/3d/Rock-peridotite.png/100px-Rock-peridotite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/3/3d/Rock-peridotite.png/150px-Rock-peridotite.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/3/3d/Rock-peridotite.png/200px-Rock-peridotite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-chromite-peridotite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/d/d3/Ore-chromite-peridotite.png/100px-Ore-chromite-peridotite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/d/d3/Ore-chromite-peridotite.png/150px-Ore-chromite-peridotite.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/d/d3/Ore-chromite-peridotite.png/200px-Ore-chromite-peridotite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kimberlito\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Rock-kimberlite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/4/4a/Rock-kimberlite.png/100px-Rock-kimberlite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/4/4a/Rock-kimberlite.png/150px-Rock-kimberlite.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/4/4a/Rock-kimberlite.png/200px-Rock-kimberlite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-chromite-kimberlite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/8/8c/Ore-chromite-kimberlite.png/100px-Ore-chromite-kimberlite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/8/8c/Ore-chromite-kimberlite.png/150px-Ore-chromite-kimberlite.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/8/8c/Ore-chromite-kimberlite.png/200px-Ore-chromite-kimberlite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p>Um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Pickaxe\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Pickaxe\">pickaxe</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Pickaxe\" title=\"Pickaxe\"> </a></span> (<a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Steel\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Steel\">steel</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Steel\" title=\"Steel\"> </a></span>) de Nível 5 ou um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Ore_blasting_bomb\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Ore blasting bomb\">ore blasting bomb</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Ore_blasting_bomb\" title=\"Ore blasting bomb\"> </a></span> é necessário para extrair minério de cromita.\n</p><p><span id=\"Processing\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Processando\">Processando</span></h2>\n<p><span id=\"Pulverizing\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Pulveriza.C3.A7.C3.A3o\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Pulverização\">Pulverização</span></h3>\n<p>Pepitas de cromita podem ser transformadas em cromita triturada em um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Pulverizer\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Pulverizer\">pulverizer</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Pulverizer\" title=\"Pulverizer\"> </a></span> equipado com tampas de libra Tier 4 (aço). 1 pepita de cromita tem 30% de chance de se transformar em 1 cromita triturada. Em média, cada 10 pepitas de cromita produzirão 3 cromita triturada.\n</p><p><span id=\"Casting\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Elenco\">Elenco</span></h3>\n<p>O cromo tem um ponto de fusão de 1907°C. Embora a cromita possa tecnicamente ser fundida em <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Casting#Filling_molds\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Casting\">ingot molds</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Casting#Filling_molds\" title=\"Casting\"> </a></span>, atualmente não há <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Fuel\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Fuel\">fuels</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Fuel\" title=\"Fuel\"> </a></span> que atinja a temperatura necessária. Lingotes e pedaços de cromo são, portanto, inalcançáveis ​​no jogo normal.\n</p><p><span id=\"Usage\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Uso\">Uso</span></h2>\n<p><span id=\"Sturdy&#95;leather\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Couro_resistente\">Couro resistente</span></h3>\n<p>2 pedaços de cromita triturada e 2L de <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Sulfuric_acid\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Sulfuric acid\">sulfuric acid</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Sulfuric_acid\" title=\"Sulfuric acid\"> </a></span> podem ser aquecidos em um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Cooking_pot\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Cooking pot\">cooking pot</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cooking_pot\" title=\"Cooking pot\"> </a></span> para fazer 1L de <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Chromium_sulfate\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Chromium sulfate\">chromium sulfate</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Chromium_sulfate\" title=\"Chromium sulfate\"> </a></span>. 3L de sulfato de cromo podem ser usados ​​para tratar 1 <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Hide\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Hide\">hide</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Hide\" title=\"Hide\"> </a></span> grande ou enorme na produção de <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Sturdy_leather\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Sturdy leather\">sturdy leather</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Sturdy_leather\" title=\"Sturdy leather\"> </a></span>, um material de artesanato para o nível mais alto de <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bags\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bags\">bags</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bags\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bags\"> </a></span>.\n</p><p><span id=\"Dyeing\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tingimento\">Tingimento</span></h3>\n<p>1 pedaço de cromita triturada e 5L de água podem ser combinados em um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Barrel\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Barrel\">barrel</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Barrel\" title=\"Barrel\"> </a></span> para fazer 5L de cromita diluída. <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Dye#Mordant\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Dye\">Mordanted cloth</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Dye#Mordant\" title=\"Dye\"> </a></span> é criado selando 2L de cromita diluída e 1 <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Cloth\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Cloth\">plain cloth</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cloth\" title=\"Cloth\"> </a></span> em um barril por 8 horas. <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Cassiterite\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Cassiterite\">cassiterite</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cassiterite\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cassiterite\"> </a></span> diluído e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Alum\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Alum\">alum</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Alum\" title=\"Alum\"> </a></span> diluído também podem ser usados. Depois de concluído, o tecido mordente pode ser tratado com qualquer cor de <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Dye#Color\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Dye\">dye</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Dye#Color\" title=\"Dye\"> </a></span>.\n</p><p><span id=\"History\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Hist.C3.B3ria\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"História\">História</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r285111\">.mw-parser-output .history th[scope=col]{background-color:#5E462A;color:#EAD3B3;border:2px solid #382b1e;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .history td{border:transparent}.mw-parser-output .history th[scope=row]{background-color:#D1B296;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .history tr:nth-child(2n/**/+1) td{background-color:#CCBCAB}.mw-parser-output .history tr:nth-child(2n) td{background-color:#E0CFBB}</style>\n<table class=\"wikitable history\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\">Versão\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Descrição\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\" rowspan=\"1\"><b><a href=\"/index.php?title=1.10.1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1.10.1 (page does not exist)\">1.10.1</a></b>\n</th>\n<th scope=\"row\"><b><a href=\"/index.php?title=1.10.1-rc.1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1.10.1-rc.1 (page does not exist)\">rc.1</a></b>\n</th>\n<td>A geração de minério de cromita foi alterada apenas para o subsolo profundo.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/index.php?title=1.12.5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1.12.5 (page does not exist)\">1.12.5</a></b>\n</th>\n<td>O tamanho dos depósitos de minério de cromita foi reduzido.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\" rowspan=\"1\"><b><a href=\"/1.17.0\" title=\"1.17.0\">1.17.0</a></b>\n</th>\n<th scope=\"row\"><b><a href=\"/1.17.0-rc.1\" title=\"1.17.0-rc.1\">rc.1</a></b>\n</th>\n<td>A receita de fabricação de corantes foi alterada de cromita diluída para água. A quantidade de cromita diluída usada para tecido mordente foi reduzida e padronizada junto com alúmen e cassiterita.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\" rowspan=\"1\"><b><a href=\"/index.php?title=1.18.0&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1.18.0 (page does not exist)\">1.18.0</a></b>\n</th>\n<th scope=\"row\"><b><a href=\"/index.php?title=1.18.0-pre.1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1.18.0-pre.1 (page does not exist)\">pre.1</a></b>\n</th>\n<td>Foi adicionada uma nova textura para cromita diluída, juntamente com alúmen e cassiterita diluídos. Cromita triturada foi adicionada.\n</td></tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span id=\"Gallery\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Galeria\">Galeria</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-nolines\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 125px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 120px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Nugget-chromite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Pepita de cromita\"><img alt=\"Pepita de cromita\" src=\"/images/thumb/8/88/Nugget-